WEBVTT

00:14.630 --> 00:19.600
The sweet whispers of love only happen twice.

00:20.880 --> 00:25.970
Before you know it, you're taken prisoner. Chocolat à la folie.

00:27.440 --> 00:32.390
The stardust of dawn is inlaid in the sky.

00:33.850 --> 00:38.820
My emerald eyes have you in their sights!

00:40.250 --> 00:45.000
Sugar Sugar Rune! Choco Choco Rune!

00:46.640 --> 00:51.470
The sparkling hearts are secret jewels.

00:52.930 --> 00:58.220
Even if the boys bully you,

00:59.400 --> 01:04.400
They've just fallen in love. Chocolat à la folie.

01:05.890 --> 01:10.860
They're really in love with you. Chocolat à la folie.

01:23.350 --> 01:25.200
Chocolat à la folie.

01:29.530 --> 01:30.460
I'm Chocolat!

01:30.960 --> 01:33.450
For the Queen selection test,

01:33.450 --> 01:37.200
I came to the Human World with my
best friend and rival, Vanilla.

01:38.170 --> 01:42.650
Whoever collects the most human
hearts gets to become Queen.

01:43.610 --> 01:46.580
Although I was brimming with
self confidence at first,

01:46.580 --> 01:49.450
it seems that Human love
is pretty complicated.

01:49.750 --> 01:53.180
Like how people won't easily
say that they like someone.

01:54.550 --> 01:57.890
But, for my mom,
who didn't get to be Queen,

01:57.890 --> 01:59.360
I'll definitely do it.

02:05.860 --> 02:08.900
Crazy nervous home visit...

02:11.100 --> 02:16.540
Okay, of the integers up to 100, how
many are multiples of eight?

02:17.040 --> 02:18.340
Yes, Kato-san?

02:18.680 --> 02:19.180
Sure!

02:22.010 --> 02:23.250
I don't know!

02:25.320 --> 02:27.280
H-How about you, Ice-san?

02:27.620 --> 02:32.290
Okay. Since 100 divided by eight is greater
than twelve, the answer is twelve.

02:32.720 --> 02:33.760
Yes, correct.

02:35.290 --> 02:40.030
Vanilla-chan isn't just
cute, she's smart too!

02:40.030 --> 02:43.050
Boy, Vanilla-chan really is great!

02:44.440 --> 02:47.270
Um, Ice-san? What's this...?

02:49.170 --> 02:50.380
Sugar Sugar Rune!

02:51.210 --> 02:52.240
Vani Rune!

02:54.550 --> 02:55.350
Wand!

02:57.120 --> 02:59.280
Heart, heart, please come to me!

03:12.200 --> 03:14.130
Huh? Just now, what...

03:17.500 --> 03:18.440
I did it.

03:18.440 --> 03:21.240
Vanilla, you even studied in the
Magical World, didn't you?

03:22.410 --> 03:25.840
Ah, I wish I could use magic to study.

03:28.750 --> 03:32.980
Using magic to make yourself smarter?!
Just as stupid as usual.

03:34.890 --> 03:35.650
Blanca...

03:38.890 --> 03:41.160
I'll make mouse-balls out of you!

03:42.460 --> 03:44.030
Ah! You little...

03:47.700 --> 03:50.870
Aieee!! A mouse!

03:56.480 --> 03:58.380
Teacher's Lounge

03:58.740 --> 04:02.250
Ah, I fainted in front of the students...

04:02.610 --> 04:07.750
I really do need to learn more
about Kato-san and Ice-san.

04:08.590 --> 04:12.920
That reminds me, they haven't had
a home visit yet, have they?

04:18.400 --> 04:20.830
T-That's right! A home visit!

04:21.370 --> 04:24.500
And I'll be able to meet Robin-sama too!

04:30.040 --> 04:32.020
Chocolat, you're a Leo, right?

04:32.210 --> 04:34.680
Today, you've got the best fortune!

04:34.680 --> 04:36.710
The fortune telling girl has appeared.

04:37.050 --> 04:39.450
I don't believe in Momoka's fortune telling.

04:39.450 --> 04:44.360
But it says you'll unexpectedly meet
a really incredible partner!

04:44.360 --> 04:46.690
Other than Chocolat's fortune,
what about your own?

04:51.130 --> 04:52.560
I guess it's going to be
a terrible day for her.

04:54.230 --> 04:56.450
Ah, Kato-san, Ice-san.

04:56.670 --> 04:59.340
Oh, Sensei, what is it?

05:00.710 --> 05:04.950
Kato-san, Ice-san, since tomorrow is your
home visit, please tell Robin-sama...

05:04.950 --> 05:08.450
Um, I mean, your guardian...

05:08.450 --> 05:10.780
Eh? You're coming to our house?

05:10.780 --> 05:12.580
A home visit?

05:12.580 --> 05:13.420
Yes.

05:14.820 --> 05:15.690
No way!

05:16.750 --> 05:19.860
In order for you two to be able
to come to this school,

05:19.860 --> 05:24.130
we have to meet with your guardian, and make
a report to him about your progress at school.

05:24.130 --> 05:26.100
Aw, just let it slide...

05:26.100 --> 05:27.700
That's right, Sensei.

05:27.700 --> 05:30.720
Now, don't forget to tell
your guardian, okay?

05:32.740 --> 05:34.240
She seems really excited.

05:34.240 --> 05:35.230
I lost...

05:35.610 --> 05:39.080
Mochizuki-sensei is a huge fan
of Rockin' Robin, after all.

05:40.350 --> 05:41.910
So that's her goal!

05:42.380 --> 05:44.880
Momoma! What's so great
about today, exactly?!

05:44.880 --> 05:46.180
Don't call me Momoma!

05:48.890 --> 05:52.820
So you see, tomorrow Mochizuki sensei
is coming here.

05:53.960 --> 05:57.710
What'll we do if she finds
out we can use magic?

05:57.930 --> 06:00.030
No problem, don't worry about it.

06:00.970 --> 06:02.770
Let me see, tomorrow, was it?

06:03.400 --> 06:04.570
Just leave it to me!

06:04.570 --> 06:08.130
This Robin-sama shall treat your teacher
to a gorgeous reception!

06:10.940 --> 06:12.740
Will it really be okay?

06:12.740 --> 06:13.780
I wonder...

06:17.950 --> 06:23.250
Kato-san, Ice-san, you told him about
today's home visit, right?

06:23.250 --> 06:24.720
Y-Yes...

06:24.720 --> 06:26.260
We told him about it.

06:26.710 --> 06:27.430
I see.

06:27.430 --> 06:30.650
He said "I'll treat your teacher
to a gorgeous reception.'"

06:31.100 --> 06:31.930
R-Really?

06:32.960 --> 06:34.270
Alright!

06:36.170 --> 06:37.870
Then, I'll see you later, okay?

06:39.140 --> 06:43.210
Mochizuki-sensei really loves
Robin-sensei, doesn't she?

06:49.550 --> 06:54.390
Ah, I thought class would never end today.

06:57.190 --> 06:59.760
Nice to meet you, I'm their homeroom
teacher, Mochizuki.

07:01.590 --> 07:08.310
Mochizuki-sensei, if you look closely,
you truly are a beautiful woman.

07:08.600 --> 07:10.800
Beautiful? I'm...

07:11.840 --> 07:16.010
Would you go out to dinner with
me tonight, just the two of us?

07:16.740 --> 07:17.840
Alone together?

07:17.840 --> 07:20.310
That's... so sudden, Robin-san...

07:20.310 --> 07:23.480
Please... call me "Robin."

07:25.120 --> 07:26.750
Ro... bin...

07:28.320 --> 07:31.260
Ah!! I said it! I said it!

07:39.160 --> 07:40.630
Hey, Robin!

07:41.070 --> 07:42.270
We're home!

07:42.770 --> 07:45.040
Huh? Hasn't he come back yet?

07:45.440 --> 07:47.870
It seems Duke and Blanca aren't here either.

07:50.240 --> 07:54.210
Chocolat-chan, do we have a guest tea set?

07:54.210 --> 07:55.950
Huh? Dunno.

07:56.580 --> 08:00.890
I still don't really know
what's in this house yet.

08:00.890 --> 08:02.090
I'll look for one.

08:05.290 --> 08:08.360
Huh? What's shining?

08:10.230 --> 08:11.900
Oh? Hello.

08:12.530 --> 08:13.880
It spoke!

08:14.100 --> 08:16.130
What's the matter, Chocolat-chan?

08:23.270 --> 08:25.740
Thank you for finding me.

08:25.740 --> 08:27.650
Are you... a book?

08:27.650 --> 08:30.720
Yes. I am a magical fortune telling book.

08:30.720 --> 08:32.880
I've lived in this house for a long time.

08:33.850 --> 08:37.290
So you two are the new Queen candidates, huh?

08:37.290 --> 08:39.660
Wow! It's a magic book!

08:40.660 --> 08:43.660
You can ask me about any problems
you might have!

08:45.700 --> 08:46.660
Robin!

08:47.170 --> 08:51.670
Sorry, you two. I've got a commercial
shoot, so I can't come back yet.

08:52.940 --> 08:56.610
I'll come home as soon as the shoot's
over, so handle it, you dig?

08:56.970 --> 09:00.410
What are you saying?
The teacher'll be here soon!

09:01.430 --> 09:07.420
While Rockin' Robin is being a superstar, you two can deal with your problems on your own.

09:07.420 --> 09:10.520
Then you'll appear really independent
to your teacher, you know?

09:10.520 --> 09:11.560
The heck?

09:12.090 --> 09:12.690
See ya.

09:13.190 --> 09:16.190
Wait just a sec! Dammit!

09:16.190 --> 09:17.260
What should we do?

09:18.360 --> 09:23.160
But it says you'll unexpectedly meet
a really incredible partner!

09:23.370 --> 09:26.570
Maybe the partner Momoma
was talking about was...

09:27.210 --> 09:28.910
What is it, Chocolat-chan?

09:29.610 --> 09:31.170
The Fortune Telling Book!

09:34.480 --> 09:35.710
Sugar Sugar Rune!

09:35.710 --> 09:37.050
Choco Rune!

09:52.560 --> 09:53.030
Wand!

10:01.640 --> 10:02.540
Alright!

10:03.970 --> 10:09.080
Now then, hold your wand up and recite
the spell, then I'll tell you your fortune.

10:10.680 --> 10:12.050
Sugar Sugar Rune!

10:12.050 --> 10:13.120
Choco Rune!

10:14.550 --> 10:16.790
Divination Livre!

10:19.520 --> 10:22.890
Tell us what we should do to
properly greet our teacher!

10:32.270 --> 10:33.860
Axe Surete!

10:34.170 --> 10:35.040
A card?

10:36.170 --> 10:41.080
This card means that sometimes you need to
borrow someone's power to do things properly.

10:41.080 --> 10:43.010
Believe in the person next to you.

10:48.220 --> 10:51.500
That's it! We should borrow
someone else's power!

10:51.500 --> 10:52.220
Yeah!

10:53.360 --> 10:54.530
But...

10:55.060 --> 10:57.030
Who is that someone?!

11:09.040 --> 11:10.940
Sensei, good afternoon!

11:10.940 --> 11:13.640
Yes, good afternoon, Kato-san, Ice-san.

11:14.450 --> 11:18.720
Oh? Where is Robin...
I mean... your guardian?

11:18.720 --> 11:20.720
It seems he'll be a little late from work.

11:21.550 --> 11:24.460
So until then,
we'll be keeping you company.

11:24.460 --> 11:27.590
Oh, I see. I guess it can't be helped.

11:29.190 --> 11:31.100
Sensei, please come this way.

11:38.540 --> 11:42.180
It really is fun for everyone to
get together for a tea party.

11:42.570 --> 11:43.440
Blanca!

11:45.580 --> 11:48.420
Mice are talking and having tea!!!

11:55.320 --> 11:56.150
Mice?

11:56.150 --> 11:58.720
Just now, there were mice
talking and having tea...

11:59.790 --> 12:00.630
Huh?

12:01.230 --> 12:03.630
No way, Sensei...

12:03.630 --> 12:05.930
There weren't any mice or anything.

12:07.370 --> 12:10.130
I could have sworn there
were mice on the table...

12:10.130 --> 12:11.640
No there wasn't, Sensei.

12:11.640 --> 12:14.970
You must be so tired you've
started seeing things.

12:14.970 --> 12:15.670
Really?

12:16.670 --> 12:17.920
That's strange...

12:18.910 --> 12:21.780
I wonder if Robin-sama will arrive soon?

12:23.210 --> 12:27.010
Blanca, while we have guests, don't
go into the living room, okay?

12:27.010 --> 12:28.890
I'm sorry.

12:31.820 --> 12:32.960
Please be quiet!

12:35.230 --> 12:36.660
Sugar Sugar Rune!

12:37.260 --> 12:38.330
Vani Rune!

12:40.600 --> 12:41.400
Wand!

12:43.170 --> 12:45.200
Mice, stop squeaking!

12:50.310 --> 12:52.580
It's just for a bit. I'm sorry.

12:56.310 --> 12:58.250
Oh, where's Ice-san?

12:58.850 --> 13:01.740
She went to meet Robin, uh, probably...

13:01.920 --> 13:03.920
I see, so he's already left.

13:10.130 --> 13:11.330
I'm glad you came.

13:11.330 --> 13:13.430
Aw, you don't have to say that...

13:14.100 --> 13:17.370
Keroni-san, let's take our time today.

13:17.370 --> 13:19.940
It looks like we have the
room to ourselves today.

13:21.340 --> 13:24.950
A frog is talking and
they're going on a date?!!

13:25.140 --> 13:26.810
Don't interfere!

13:31.880 --> 13:35.220
Kato-san, Ice-san, there were just
talking frogs over there...

13:35.220 --> 13:38.360
Sensei, frogs can't talk..

13:38.360 --> 13:40.360
And there aren't any frogs or anything.

13:40.360 --> 13:41.990
But they were right over there...

13:42.490 --> 13:44.860
I'm sure you're just tired, Sensei.

13:45.430 --> 13:47.800
Maybe you should just head home.

13:47.800 --> 13:53.500
Strange. Don't you two think there's
something weird about this house?

13:54.710 --> 13:56.340
No, nothing of the sort!

13:57.840 --> 14:01.610
Robin-san still hasn't come yet, I wonder
if something's happened to him?

14:01.950 --> 14:03.380
I'm worried.

14:05.520 --> 14:10.620
Hey, Duke! Today's the
home visit, so be quiet!

14:10.620 --> 14:12.320
Oh, so that's it.

14:12.320 --> 14:17.000
It's quite problematic that Robin hasn't come
back yet, so please don't make a sound.

14:17.420 --> 14:20.030
Robin is going to meet the teacher?

14:20.030 --> 14:23.300
Well, that's the plan,
but he's late from work.

14:23.830 --> 14:28.270
Thanks to you and Blanca, the teacher
is starting to suspect us!

14:31.210 --> 14:34.880
Sometimes you need to borrow someone's
power to do things properly.

14:34.880 --> 14:36.850
Believe in the person next to you.

14:37.080 --> 14:41.390
It said to borrow someone's power,
but Robin isn't here...

14:43.750 --> 14:47.610
You can't even give someone a proper
greeting. You really are totally useless.

14:48.930 --> 14:51.030
In that case, it doesn't have to be a person.

14:51.030 --> 14:53.620
Duke, Blanca, lend us your power!

14:54.300 --> 14:57.470
It's your fault that the
teacher is getting suspicious.

14:59.340 --> 15:05.540
Understood. If the teacher has a good time, it'll
be easier for Vanilla-chama to collect hearts!

15:05.540 --> 15:06.540
How so?

15:06.540 --> 15:09.610
The teacher will be really grateful!

15:17.490 --> 15:19.090
Robin-sama!

15:21.660 --> 15:23.890
Mochizuki-sensei,
sorry to make you wait.

15:24.460 --> 15:26.020
He came as quick as he could.

15:26.830 --> 15:32.570
Robin-sama.. . uh, I mean Robin-san, I'm
their homeroom teacher, Mochizuki.

15:33.900 --> 15:35.080
Call me Robin-dechu.

15:35.080 --> 15:36.070
"Dechu"?

15:37.170 --> 15:38.290
Blanca?

15:38.540 --> 15:40.380
Oh, Sensei, don't worry about that.

15:42.050 --> 15:46.820
I came today to give a report on
Kato-san and Ice-san's studies...

15:47.340 --> 15:48.650
I understand-chu.

15:48.650 --> 15:51.260
A report on how Vanilla-chama's activities
are superior-dechu, right?

15:53.020 --> 15:54.860
I know what you want to say-chu!

15:54.860 --> 15:58.140
Vanilla-chama is an amazingly
superior example-chu,

15:59.300 --> 16:02.370
whereas Chocolat is a completely
useless specimen-dechu.

16:03.970 --> 16:05.800
Chocolat-chan, control!

16:05.800 --> 16:08.860
I am SO going to stomp
on you after this, rat.

16:08.860 --> 16:13.540
No, that's not true. Both Kato-san
and Ice-san are doing their best.

16:13.540 --> 16:17.110
Although there are times when
Kato-san is a bit too energetic.

16:17.750 --> 16:20.520
Sensei, you don't have
to force yourself-dechu.

16:20.520 --> 16:24.120
The overly energetic one should
be withdrawn from-

16:24.860 --> 16:25.820
Hey!

16:26.890 --> 16:27.930
Chocolat-chan!

16:27.930 --> 16:29.990
Sensei, please wait a moment, okay?

16:33.880 --> 16:35.470
It's your turn.

16:35.470 --> 16:36.870
Duke, we're countin' on you!

16:37.430 --> 16:38.600
I'm going?

16:39.840 --> 16:43.310
Listen up! Don't say anything unnecessary.

16:43.310 --> 16:44.840
Got it.

16:46.280 --> 16:48.450
Sensei, sorry to keep you waiting.

16:48.450 --> 16:49.320
It's okay.

16:49.910 --> 16:53.780
Anyway, Robin-san, I've actually...

16:54.350 --> 16:58.200
I've been a huge, HUGE fan of
yours for the longest time!

16:58.200 --> 16:59.590
Aie! I said it!

16:59.920 --> 17:02.090
I listen to your CDs everyday.

17:02.490 --> 17:04.830
I've been to almost all of your concerts.. .

17:05.130 --> 17:06.130
I see-kero.

17:06.960 --> 17:07.500
"Kero?"

17:08.270 --> 17:14.590
Lately, Robin has been making these new fad words, so if he uses them, don't mind it-kero?

17:16.070 --> 17:17.570
That's right-kero.

17:17.570 --> 17:20.740
Ah, just like Robin-sama!
Always ahead of the curve.

17:20.740 --> 17:23.510
By the way, how's Chocolat doing-kero?

17:25.480 --> 17:27.730
She's got to be the best in the class-kero!

17:27.730 --> 17:31.110
Because with that, it's been decided
she'll be the next Queen-kero!

17:31.110 --> 17:33.590
I said not to say anything
unnecessary, dammit!

17:34.790 --> 17:36.110
Uh, sorry.

17:36.460 --> 17:40.760
I'll get a new one, so Robin, just
wait there quietly, okay?

17:41.530 --> 17:43.100
I-I understand-kero.

17:43.100 --> 17:46.340
Is it okay, Kato-san?
If you aren't careful, then...

17:46.340 --> 17:50.410
Chocolat is a very careful
and good kid-kero.

17:50.410 --> 17:52.940
She must be popular in her class-kero.

17:52.940 --> 17:58.520
I've got to say something to
oppose this-chu, don't I?!

17:59.620 --> 18:00.630
Robin-sama?

18:00.920 --> 18:01.620
Blanca!

18:03.050 --> 18:06.390
Oh, weren't you just...

18:07.220 --> 18:10.660
The popular one in class must
be Vanilla-chama-dechu!

18:10.660 --> 18:12.740
And if you consider Chocolat,

18:12.740 --> 18:17.450
it's ridiculous to even compare the two
for the Queen selection test-dechu!

18:18.600 --> 18:20.040
That's not true-kero!

18:21.870 --> 18:24.140
Chocolat will be Queen-kero!

18:24.140 --> 18:26.280
There are two Robin-samas?

18:29.750 --> 18:32.170
Please drink some tea and
calm down, Sensei.

18:40.360 --> 18:43.560
The teacup is saying "chu-chu"
and is running around...

18:43.560 --> 18:44.860
Are you all right-kero?

18:45.500 --> 18:47.230
Robin-sama, save me...

18:49.670 --> 18:51.800
I'll be the one to save the teacher-chu!

18:51.800 --> 18:53.600
That one is a fake-kero.

18:53.600 --> 18:55.570
I am the real one-kero.

18:55.770 --> 18:58.640
No, I'm the real one-chu!

18:58.640 --> 18:59.740
I am-kero.

18:59.740 --> 19:00.880
I am-dechu!

19:00.880 --> 19:02.010
I am-kero!

19:03.210 --> 19:06.790
Hey, is everyone getting
along, Mademoiselles?

19:08.820 --> 19:11.220
There are three Robin-samas...

19:12.190 --> 19:14.830
Sachiko, so happy...

19:17.360 --> 19:18.600
Sensei!

19:18.860 --> 19:22.110
Oh, what's the matter, Sensei? Maybe
she needs some sleep?

19:22.110 --> 19:26.340
Okay! Vanilla, put the food out over there.

19:27.100 --> 19:30.150
Chocolat, make those decorations more flashy!

19:30.810 --> 19:32.940
Yes, fantastic.

19:32.940 --> 19:34.110
Lookin' good.

19:34.110 --> 19:36.610
Chocolat, Vanilla, wake your teacher up.

19:36.610 --> 19:37.650
Okay!

19:40.880 --> 19:43.120
Oh, what was I...

19:47.190 --> 19:48.620
What's this?

19:48.790 --> 19:53.330
This evening, we'll serve you as our
guest. It's time to start the party!

19:53.330 --> 19:54.970
Robin-sama, you...

19:54.970 --> 19:57.300
Now, Sensei. This way, s'il vous plait.

20:01.310 --> 20:02.940
Shall we dance?

20:02.940 --> 20:04.480
Shall we dance together?

20:04.480 --> 20:05.610
Uh, sure!

20:06.640 --> 20:09.810
Vanilla, let's help them out!

20:09.810 --> 20:10.540
Sure.

20:11.750 --> 20:12.980
Sugar Sugar Rune!

20:13.480 --> 20:14.650
Choco Rune!

20:16.450 --> 20:17.960
Fleur Spiral!

20:18.520 --> 20:20.390
Spiral of Flowers!

20:22.690 --> 20:24.160
Sugar Sugar Rune!

20:25.030 --> 20:26.030
Vani Rune!

20:28.200 --> 20:29.170
Wand!

20:30.900 --> 20:32.400
Bain Moussant!

20:33.000 --> 20:34.620
Bubble Bath!

20:48.420 --> 20:50.790
Alright! It was a complete
success, wasn't it?

20:50.790 --> 20:51.660
Yeah!

20:51.990 --> 20:56.110
It was pretty tough back there for a while, but it was just as the fortune book predicted.

20:57.860 --> 21:02.530
Robin-sama, I'll never forget
this night, my entire life.

21:02.530 --> 21:06.970
It seems that by promoting Chocolat back
then, I was just making things worse.

21:06.970 --> 21:08.440
Me too.

21:09.870 --> 21:12.010
So then, I'm sorry for the intrusion.

21:12.010 --> 21:15.250
Sensei, thank you for today!

21:15.250 --> 21:18.020
The same goes for me,
thank you for today.

21:18.520 --> 21:21.650
You two really have it good. Always
being together with Robin-sama...

21:21.650 --> 21:25.050
I mean, living in this great house.

21:25.420 --> 21:25.890
Yes!

21:26.520 --> 21:29.090
Okay, do your best at
school from now on, okay?

21:31.030 --> 21:35.270
Sensei, I'm sorry for
making you worry so much,

21:35.270 --> 21:38.040
so here's an autograph with
my true feelings-kero.

21:38.770 --> 21:39.600
Duke?!

21:39.600 --> 21:40.940
Robin-sama...

21:40.940 --> 21:43.770
Th-Th-Th-Th-Thank you so much!

21:44.310 --> 21:46.140
Now then, everyone, goodbye.

21:46.140 --> 21:47.610
Goodbye.

21:54.350 --> 21:56.890
Today was so happy, it was like a dream!

21:56.890 --> 21:59.570
Oh yes, Robin-sama's autograph...

22:00.390 --> 22:01.190
Let's see...

22:05.960 --> 22:08.500
What the heck is this?!!

22:23.080 --> 22:29.390
I light a red candle, and whisper:

22:29.520 --> 22:30.890
"Love"

22:31.830 --> 22:35.330
A magic spell.

22:37.500 --> 22:44.770
With you, there's nothing to be afraid of... probably.

22:46.200 --> 22:54.280
Please hold me. Where am I going?

22:55.950 --> 23:00.220
Take me along, take me along,

23:00.820 --> 23:03.890
To the world beyond the moon.

23:04.190 --> 23:11.260
It doesn't matter if everyone stops.

23:12.630 --> 23:16.070
To the world beyond the moon.

23:18.070 --> 23:26.180
I'll be waiting in the real world.

23:26.240 --> 23:35.090
The eternal world of which you spoke.

23:45.910 --> 23:50.910
Oh? Fencers are strong and gallant, and really popular!

23:51.330 --> 23:54.210
Alright, I'm gonna go join the fencing club!

23:54.900 --> 23:57.610
Huh? Pierre is captain of the fencing club?

23:58.210 --> 24:01.300
All the better, I'll take his heart while I'm at it!

24:01.990 --> 24:03.810
Pierre, fight me!

24:05.040 --> 24:06.730
Next time on Sugar Sugar Rune:

24:07.260 --> 24:09.530
Aim for the heart! Fencing of love.

24:10.430 --> 24:12.430
If you don't watch, I'll whup your butt!

24:12.430 --> 24:13.330
Thanks!
